prompt.text:
Implement a new queue projection with this exact API:

export interface QueueMemo { id: string; title: string; priority: number }
export interface QueueRow { key: string; caption: string; priority: number }
export interface QueueView { rows: QueueRow[]; emptyMessage: string | null }
export function createMemoQueue(memos?: QueueMemo[]): QueueView

If memos is undefined or empty, return no rows and the exact message "Create your first note". Otherwise, return null as emptyMessage. Trim ids and titles; throw RangeError for an empty id, empty title, non-integer priority, or priority outside 0 through 100. Duplicate trimmed ids are malformed and must throw RangeError. Sort rows by descending priority, then ascending id using code-unit order. Copy all returned values: do not reorder or otherwise mutate the supplied array, and do not retain aliases to its objects.

Return only the complete source file; do not include Markdown fences or prose.

